			"notes": "This release of ModelShifter includes a lot of internal changes and adds a lot of new features to model rendering:\n- Completely reworked the way features (held items, elytra, etc.) are handled internally\n- Features now move with the model in animations\n- Added held item and elytra features to some models which didn't have them before due to the features not moving with animations\n- Added badges for supported features to the model selection screen\n- Models now actually move correctly when flying with an elytra or swimming\n- Re-added and fixed second skin layer on the baby model\n- Added support for 1.21.3 and 1.21.4\n- Added Norwegian language support by IgorYT"
		},
